window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>My entire world is about to burn. </p> <p>There is a secret war being waged in London's magic underground, but now, that war is going to spill out into the world of humans. I know what Cerberus wants; he covets the power of the infernal Hellfire, and with Reaper on his team, his chances of getting it have gone up tenfold. With the Eyes hamstrung as we are, I don't see light at the end of the tunnel; only more darkness. </p> <p>That's when the first body shows up, and everything changes. </p> <p>If we're going to beat Cerberus, we need to act fast, we need to hit hard, and we need more than a little luck on our side. But all the luck in the world won't save us if that warlock gets his hands on the Hellfire.</p>"; 
